          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngolunye usuku efundisa, kwakuhlezi khona abaFarisi nabafundisi bomthetho ababephuma kuyo yonke imizi yaseGalile, naseJudiya, naseJerusalema, namandla eNkosi. Khona ukubaphulukisa.",
          "type": "text",
