              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuthe bengafumani indlela yokumngenisa ngenxa yesixuku, bakhwela phezu kwendlu, bamehlisa othayela ngohlaka, bamehlisa phakathi phambi kukaJesu.",
