        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha ukuze nazi ukuthi iNdodana yomuntu inamandla emhlabeni okuthethelela izono,” wathi kofe uhlangothi: “Ngithi kuwe: Vuka, uthathe uhlaka lwakho, uye endlini yakho.",
          "type": "text",
