              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasukuma masinyane phambi kwabo, wathatha lokho abelele kukho, wamuka waya endlini yakhe, ekhazimulisa uNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
